      "message": "Yes, the kernel module is in the next change in that chain: aosp/4298491\n\nAs we discussed, because intermediate fds are being exposed to userland during the loading, we have to modify the internal code to account for that. I tried to minimise as much as possible the changes here to avoid merge conflicts in the future.",
